TITLE 1D transport: Ca/Na-Cl with exchange (explicit Alkalinity)

SOLUTION 0  Infilling
    pH 7.0
    units mol/kgw
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
    Alkalinity 0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    units mol/kgw
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
    Alkalinity 0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001

EQUILIBRATE 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -step true
    -state true
    -solution true
    -totals Alkalinity

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions constant constant
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -time_step 1
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -correct_disp true
    -print_cells 3
    -punch_cells 3
END
